		<description><![CDATA[I met Daniel / Jami when we were at Khanqah S.A.M. in San Francisco.  He was a gifted artist who designed incredible posters for concerts for the Sufi Choir, Hamza El Din, the Healing Prayer of Inayat, and other things.  He had a great sense of humor, and the women were crazy about him.  Vasheest used to calll him Errol Flynn.  Blessings upon you, brother.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I met Daniel / Jami when we were at Khanqah S.A.M. in San Francisco.  He was a gifted artist who designed incredible posters for concerts for the Sufi Choir, Hamza El Din, the Healing Prayer of Inayat, and other things.  He had a great sense of humor, and the women were crazy about him.  Vasheest used to calll him Errol Flynn.  Blessings upon you, brother.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
