	<item>
		<title>By: Donald Kinney</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=658&#038;cpage=1#comment-6985</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Donald Kinney]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 20 Feb 2011 00:23:28 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=658#comment-6985</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[I received news of Dan&#039;s passing only recently.  I had helped him move from Fairfax to Lakeville and then a bit later into Petaluma.  He was a dear friend and confidant.  Probably the smartest person I have ever known -- yet he took me under his wing teaching me all sorts of things that I would have never known.  Just way too early for him to depart this earth.  I&#039;ll miss him.  One of the finest and most honorable persons I&#039;ve ever met.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I received news of Dan&#8217;s passing only recently.  I had helped him move from Fairfax to Lakeville and then a bit later into Petaluma.  He was a dear friend and confidant.  Probably the smartest person I have ever known &#8212; yet he took me under his wing teaching me all sorts of things that I would have never known.  Just way too early for him to depart this earth.  I&#8217;ll miss him.  One of the finest and most honorable persons I&#8217;ve ever met.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
